    "Used for querying global MusicBrainz recordings via Chromaprint.\nNote: AcoustID distinguishes between Application Key and User Key. Query service must use Application Key." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bo" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chromaprint སྒྲ་རིས་བརྒྱུད་ནས་འཛམ་གླིང་ MusicBrainz སྒྲ་ཕབ་དངོས་པོ་འཚོལ་བར་སྤྱོད།\nདོ་སྣང་བྱ་རྒྱུར: AcoustID ཡིས་ Application Key དང་ User Key དབྱེ་འབྱེད་བྱེད།"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Used for querying global MusicBrainz recordings via Chromaprint.\nNote: AcoustID distinguishes between Application Key and User Key. Query service must use Application Key."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Chromaprintを介して世界中のMusicBrainz録音を照会するために使用します。\n注意：AcoustIDではApplication KeyとUser Keyを区別します。照会サービスではApplication Keyを使用する必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于通过 Chromaprint 声学指纹查询全球 MusicBrainz 录音实体。\n注意：AcoustID 区分 Application Key 与 User Key，查询服务必须使用 Application Key。"
          }
